## How it was built and tested
- Tool: MySQL 8.0 with MySQL Workbench.
- To recreate: open `schema.sql` in Workbench and run it. It creates the
  `west_haven_hotel` database and all eight tables.
- Testing: after running the script, `SHOW TABLES;` lists all eight tables (see
  the screenshot above), and `SELECT * FROM guests;` runs without errors on the
  empty table.